{"1627210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Morgenstern", "steam_appid": 1627210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/8563b10d917b25422cf4b6934f064596.avif?t=1759747134\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgenstern is a single-player and multiplayer roguelite hack-and-slash adventure with extraction mechanics, developed by a team whose previous credits include Lead Animator on 'Manhunt 2', Producer on 'No Rest For The Wicked', and Destruction Artists on 'Split Second'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/a62e03d1de3a1432631028251e6371eb.poster.avif?t=1759747134\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/a62e03d1de3a1432631028251e6371eb.webm?t=1759747134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Morgenstern,&quot; you dive into a procedurally generated world to defeat hordes of dangerous enemies and find valuable treasures. Once you successfully conquer the final dungeon of a biome, new, even more challenging adventures await. The extraction mechanic requires strategic decisions on when to push forward and when to retreat to secure your loot and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/27ec99bd1665eb212e7f983eb9f0ad2f.poster.avif?t=1759747134\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/27ec99bd1665eb212e7f983eb9f0ad2f.webm?t=1759747134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESTROY YOUR ENEMIES - AND THE ENVIRONMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying objects in the environment allows you to gather resources, replenish Health, Mana, and Armor, and find new weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/abaf8f0e950a3deb4f929797678256ff.poster.avif?t=1759747134\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/abaf8f0e950a3deb4f929797678256ff.webm?t=1759747134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION AND IMPROVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up during combat by killing enemies and gaining reputation. Acquire new weapons, spells, and abilities to gain even more combat power. Permanently improve all characters by collecting valuable crystals used to upgrade the Morgenstern and, in turn, enhance your characters' abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/3461aa3ea92dfcc1442beaee497b5298.poster.avif?t=1759747134\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/3461aa3ea92dfcc1442beaee497b5298.webm?t=1759747134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOGETHER OR AGAINST EACH OTHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in co-op mode or test your skills against other players in intense PvP battles. In PvP mode, you encounter opponents who, once defeated, will fight by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game's PvE mode, you face challenging AI opponents, providing plenty of entertainment and opportunities for sustainable improvement, even in solo mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/7910efe15a39de5322d59a4301f14f4a.poster.avif?t=1759747134\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/7910efe15a39de5322d59a4301f14f4a.webm?t=1759747134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BACON BACKUP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you die in PvE, you return as a pig, giving you one last chance to defeat your enemies and escape with loot and reputation. This unique mechanic adds an exciting twist to the gameplay and ensures that no run is truly over until the bitter end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME PART OF THE ADVENTURE NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to inscribe your saga into the chronicles of legends? Download &quot;Morgenstern&quot; now and embark on an epic medieval journey like no other.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/8563b10d917b25422cf4b6934f064596.avif?t=1759747134\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgenstern is a single-player and multiplayer roguelite hack-and-slash adventure with extraction mechanics, developed by a team whose previous credits include Lead Animator on 'Manhunt 2', Producer on 'No Rest For The Wicked', and Destruction Artists on 'Split Second'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/a62e03d1de3a1432631028251e6371eb.poster.avif?t=1759747134\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/a62e03d1de3a1432631028251e6371eb.webm?t=1759747134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Morgenstern,&quot; you dive into a procedurally generated world to defeat hordes of dangerous enemies and find valuable treasures. Once you successfully conquer the final dungeon of a biome, new, even more challenging adventures await. The extraction mechanic requires strategic decisions on when to push forward and when to retreat to secure your loot and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/27ec99bd1665eb212e7f983eb9f0ad2f.poster.avif?t=1759747134\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/27ec99bd1665eb212e7f983eb9f0ad2f.webm?t=1759747134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESTROY YOUR ENEMIES - AND THE ENVIRONMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying objects in the environment allows you to gather resources, replenish Health, Mana, and Armor, and find new weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/abaf8f0e950a3deb4f929797678256ff.poster.avif?t=1759747134\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/abaf8f0e950a3deb4f929797678256ff.webm?t=1759747134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION AND IMPROVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up during combat by killing enemies and gaining reputation. Acquire new weapons, spells, and abilities to gain even more combat power. Permanently improve all characters by collecting valuable crystals used to upgrade the Morgenstern and, in turn, enhance your characters' abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/3461aa3ea92dfcc1442beaee497b5298.poster.avif?t=1759747134\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/3461aa3ea92dfcc1442beaee497b5298.webm?t=1759747134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOGETHER OR AGAINST EACH OTHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in co-op mode or test your skills against other players in intense PvP battles. In PvP mode, you encounter opponents who, once defeated, will fight by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game's PvE mode, you face challenging AI opponents, providing plenty of entertainment and opportunities for sustainable improvement, even in solo mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/7910efe15a39de5322d59a4301f14f4a.poster.avif?t=1759747134\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/7910efe15a39de5322d59a4301f14f4a.webm?t=1759747134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BACON BACKUP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you die in PvE, you return as a pig, giving you one last chance to defeat your enemies and escape with loot and reputation. This unique mechanic adds an exciting twist to the gameplay and ensures that no run is truly over until the bitter end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME PART OF THE ADVENTURE NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to inscribe your saga into the chronicles of legends? Download &quot;Morgenstern&quot; now and embark on an epic medieval journey like no other.</p>", "short_description": "Embark on a wild Singleplayer, Coop, and PvP Roguelite Hack and Slash Adventure! Dive into medieval worlds and battle insane enemies. Master dungeons, smash everything to pieces, grab the loot, extract strategically - or die like a poor pig.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/cda54815d96670a8af30fbdd75fe5c206d0872d2/header.jpg?t=1759747134", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/50fdb1a217028689b2d9e93a5ff821867953cc12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759747134", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/50fdb1a217028689b2d9e93a5ff821867953cc12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759747134", "website": "https://morgenstern-game.com/", "pc_requirements": {"mi